<title>UK: LME copper backwardation wide, zinc above $1,500.</title>
<headline>LME copper backwardation wide, zinc above $1,500.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Cash/threes backwardation stays flared at $210/$220, versus $130/$140 on Friday. Firmer at $2,315, boosted by third Wednesday pricing.</p>
<p>ZINC - Stronger, at new 6-3/4 year highs above $1,500.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Firmer with copper.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Comes off day's lows.</p>
</text>
